  "title": "The Best Vanilla Bean Cheesecake",
  "description": "Homemade vanilla bean cheesecake topped with white chocolate mousse and vanilla bean whipped cream — just like you'd get at The Cheesecake Factory!",
  "authors": [
    "littlebit86"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:21:26-04:00",
